[length:06:20]
[ti:I SURVIVED WRONG]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfuntional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:02.60]I came back...
[00:09.03]but not the way they wanted.
[00:41.64]I learned to kneel
[00:43.02]with my spine still straight
[00:45.79]I learned to smile
[00:47.35]at the mouth of the gate
[00:49.94]They dressed up the wound
[00:51.82]like a lesson in grace
[00:54.26]put a crown on the ribs
[00:56.51]and called it a place
[00:59.32]I followed the thread
[01:01.06]through the smoke and the glass
[01:03.38]counting every future
[01:05.43]that was never meant to last
[01:07.94]Little bells in the ceiling
[01:10.11]little eyes in the walls
[01:12.33]little saints made of static
[01:14.63]singing “lla ta leef t’nod”
[01:17.58]Ah-ah-ah...
[01:19.81]under the floor
[01:22.09]Ya-ah-ah...
[01:24.31]behind the locked door
[01:26.73]I buried my name
[01:28.56]where the dead songs belong
[01:30.63]but it crawled through the dirt singing:
[01:34.51]I survived
[01:35.74]WRONG
[01:36.73]I survived wrong
[01:38.21]I survived wrong
[01:40.63]not clean, not wise
[01:42.40]not saved, not gone
[01:44.95]Aah, I came back cracked
[01:46.86]with my teeth still on
[01:49.00]I didn’t get better
[01:52.98]I survived wrong
[01:54.78]I survived gnorw
[01:56.12]under a burning sky
[01:58.28]not blessed by the angels
[02:00.59]not chosen to rise
[02:03.19]I crawled from the ending
[02:05.04]with my shadow long
[02:07.24]I didn’t get better
[02:09.64]I survived wrong
[02:12.44]They wanted a girl
[02:13.73]with her damage well-trained
[02:14.74]a wind-up little martyr
[02:15.89]with manageable pain
[02:16.96]They wanted my rage
[02:18.03]in a porcelain bowl
[02:19.16]wanted blood on the carpet
[02:20.26]but no stain on the soul
[02:21.44]So I learned every prayer
[02:22.68]with a knife in my lung
[02:23.81]learned the shape of obedience
[02:24.96]on the back of my tongue
[02:26.08]And I danced for the mirror
[02:27.24]till the mirror went blind
[02:28.34]till the child in the corner
[02:29.44]started laughing inside
[02:31.28]No, I’m not your miracle
[02:33.13]I’m not your proof
[02:35.21]I’m not the clean little ending
[02:38.34]that comforts the room
[02:40.94]Ah-ah-ah...
[02:42.33]I lost every halo
[02:44.33]Ya-ah-ah...
[02:46.50]I carried too long
[02:49.01]but the dark opened up
[02:50.80]and I sang with it:
[02:53.43]I 
[02:54.68]SURVIVED
[02:56.95]WRONG
[02:58.63]I survived gnorw
[03:00.51]I survived wrong
[03:02.80]not clean, not wise
[03:04.72]not saved, not gone
[03:07.12]Aah, I came back cracked
[03:09.22]with my teeth still on
[03:11.29]I didn’t get better
[03:13.83]I survived wrong
[03:16.47]I survived wrong
[03:18.35]under a burning sky
[03:20.55]not blessed by the angels
[03:22.71]not chosen to rise
[03:25.11]I crawled from the ending
[03:27.22]with my shadow long
[03:29.48]I didn’t get better
[03:31.61]I 
[03:32.98]SURVIVED
[03:34.14]WRONG
[03:37.50]Wrong, gnorw, wrong
[03:41.17]still here, still gnorw
[03:46.42]Wrong, gnorw, wrong
[03:50.33]still here, still gnorw
[03:53.99]There was a door
[03:55.09]but it opened to fire
[03:57.75]There was a road
[03:59.27]but it bent like a wire
[04:02.20]There was a God
[04:03.93]but it spoke like a screen
[04:06.98]There was a child
[04:08.59]and she looked just like me
[04:10.80]I held her close
[04:13.16]with my hands full of teeth
[04:15.28]I said:
[04:16.61]“Little ghost,
[04:17.83]you can still breathe.”
[04:22.86]through the wire
[04:27.24]through the flame
[04:29.44]THE FIRE
[04:32.00]not an angel
[04:36.32]not ashamed
[04:48.02]Still here.
[04:49.15]Still here.
[04:50.13]Still here.
[04:51.61]Wrong.
[04:52.57]Still here.
[04:53.62]Still here.
[04:54.65]gnorw.
[04:57.32]Still here.
[04:58.40]WRONG.
[04:59.32]I didn’t heal pretty.
[05:01.26]I didn’t die young.
[05:03.21]I didn’t turn holy.
[05:06.42]I survived wrong.
[05:14.80]I survived wrong
[05:16.16]I survived gnorw
[05:18.01]not clean, not wise
[05:19.57]not saved, not gone
[05:21.93]Aah, I came back cracked
[05:24.28]with my teeth still on
[05:26.20]I didn’t get better
[05:28.90]I survived wrong
[05:31.39]I survived wrong
[05:33.40]under a burning sky
[05:35.37]not blessed by the angels
[05:37.43]not chosen to rise
[05:40.06]I crawled from the ending
[05:42.15]with my shadow long
[05:44.42]I didn’t get better
[05:47.15]I survived wrong
[05:49.18]Wrong, gnorw, wrong
[05:52.75]still here, still strong
[05:56.08]Wrong, gnorw, wrong
[05:57.44]still here, still gnorw
[05:58.66]Wrong, gnorw, wrong
[05:59.71]still here, still strong
[06:01.21]I didn’t get better
[06:04.63]I survived wrong
[06:08.54]I came back...
[06:11.50]but not the way they wanted.
[06:14.69]I survived wrong.
[06:16.78]And I don’t know what’s coming next.
